    "parse_ok": true,
    "reply": "Thanks for checking before clearing space — I understand the concern, and I'm sorry for the uncertainty the app's wording has caused.\n\nI can't confirm from the information available here whether deleting a file on your device also removes the synced copy, so please don't delete anything yet on the assumption that the cloud copy is a separate backup. The app's use of \"backup\" for cloud sync doesn't by itself establish that the two copies are independent.\n\nAn internal verification request on this exact question has been created and is pending. In the meantime, the safest customer-controlled step is to keep the file in place, or move it to another location you control, until the sync behaviour is confirmed. If you can reply with the app name and version, and the platform you're using (for example iOS or Android), that will help identify the correct behaviour for your setup. You're also welcome to ask for progress on the pending check at any time.",
